OL,3,GNEWSAFresh bid to solve leaking boating
OL,4,Apond mystery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fresh round of investigation work is
OL,7,Fto attempt to solve the mystery of a
OL,8,Fwater leak which has left a Victorian
OL,9,Fboating pond in southern Scotland high
OL,10,Fand dry.
OL,12,FThere have been ongoing issues at the
OL,13,Fattraction in the tourist town of
OL,14,FMoffat since a section of the wall
OL,15,Fsurrounding it collapsed more than
OL,16,Fthree years ago.
OL,18,FIt has been a source of frustration for
OL,19,Flocals and visitors alike with a
OL,20,Flong-term solution proving difficult to
OL,21,Ffind.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
